The change narrows `camp_block` so that unseen spawn tiles of groups currently respawning no longer count as blocked. Those camps are probably empty after being cleared, so the bot can path through them. Visible camps still block.

```python
@gene("w2b", "tiles holding a camp (seen, or unseen camp spawns of groups not respawning)", parents=["w2"])
def camp_block() -> Tiles:
